{
  "$comment": "Plain requests for the authoring instrument. The author sees only `request`; it chooses its own state, actions and layout. Each probe uses the application as a person would (a field or button found by its words) and checks text any correct application shows. A probe is the judge; the author's own checks never are.",
  "version": 3,
  "$history": [
    "2: the shopping request says the list starts empty; version 1 left it open, and three applications that began with sample items were judged wrong for counting them (run of 2026-11-18, 21 of 24).",
    "3: each task has a Dutch request (`requests.nl`) and its probes also find Dutch labels; the English requests and every expected text are unchanged."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "bill",
      "request": "Make me a bill splitter. I type the bill amount, a tip percentage and how many people are paying; it shows the tip, the total and what each person pays.",
      "probes": [
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "amount|bill|bedrag|rekening"
              },
              "type": "100"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "tip|fooi"
              },
              "type": "10"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "people|persons|person|split|guests|mensen|personen|aantal"
              },
              "type": "4"
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "110",
              "27.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "requests": {
        "nl": "Maak een rekeningsplitser voor me. Ik typ het bedrag van de rekening, een fooipercentage en met hoeveel mensen we betalen; hij toont de fooi, het totaal en wat ieder betaalt."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "templog",
      "request": "A temperature log: I type a reading and add it to the log. Show every reading, and the average (one decimal), the lowest and the highest.",
      "probes": [
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "reading|temperature|temp|°|meting|temperatuur"
              },
              "type": "12"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "add|log|save|record|toevoeg|voeg|opslaan|bewaar"
              }
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "reading|temperature|temp|°|meting|temperatuur"
              },
              "type": "18"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "add|log|save|record|toevoeg|voeg|opslaan|bewaar"
              }
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "reading|temperature|temp|°|meting|temperatuur"
              },
              "type": "15.5"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "add|log|save|record|toevoeg|voeg|opslaan|bewaar"
              }
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "15.2",
              "12",
              "18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "requests": {
        "nl": "Een temperatuurlogboek: ik typ een meting en voeg die toe aan het logboek. Toon elke meting, en het gemiddelde (één decimaal), de laagste en de hoogste."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "contacts",
      "request": "A contact list with these five people: Ada (ada@example.org, Amsterdam), Bram (bram@example.org, Utrecht), Chen (chen@example.org, Amsterdam), Dana (dana@example.org, Rotterdam) and Emre (emre@example.org, Utrecht). A search box shows only the contacts whose name or city contains what I type, ignoring upper and lower case.",
      "probes": [
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "search|filter|find|zoek"
              },
              "type": "amster"
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "Ada",
              "Chen"
            ],
            "absent": [
              "Bram",
              "Dana",
              "Emre"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "search|filter|find|zoek"
              },
              "type": "UTRECHT"
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "Bram",
              "Emre"
            ],
            "absent": [
              "Ada",
              "Chen",
              "Dana"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "requests": {
        "nl": "Een contactenlijst met deze vijf mensen: Ada (ada@example.org, Amsterdam), Bram (bram@example.org, Utrecht), Chen (chen@example.org, Amsterdam), Dana (dana@example.org, Rotterdam) en Emre (emre@example.org, Utrecht). Een zoekveld toont alleen de contacten waarvan de naam of de stad bevat wat ik typ, ongeacht hoofdletters."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "counter",
      "request": "A counter with a plus and a minus button, a field for the step size, and a reset button that sets it back to zero.",
      "probes": [
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "step|stap"
              },
              "type": "7"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "^\\s*\\+|plus|increase|increment|add|up|verhoog|meer"
              }
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "^\\s*\\+|plus|increase|increment|add|up|verhoog|meer"
              }
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "step|stap"
              },
              "type": "7"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "^\\s*\\+|plus|increase|increment|add|up|verhoog|meer"
              }
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "^\\s*\\+|plus|increase|increment|add|up|verhoog|meer"
              }
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "reset|clear|zero|wis|nul"
              }
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "absent": [
              "14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "requests": {
        "nl": "Een teller met een plus- en een minknop, een veld voor de stapgrootte en een resetknop die hem terugzet op nul."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "distance",
      "request": "Convert kilometres to miles: I type a distance in kilometres and see it in miles with two decimals.",
      "probes": [
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "km|kilomet|distance|afstand"
              },
              "type": "10"
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "km|kilomet|distance|afstand"
              },
              "type": "42.195"
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "requests": {
        "nl": "Reken kilometers om naar mijlen: ik typ een afstand in kilometers en zie die in mijlen met twee decimalen."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shopping",
      "request": "A shopping list that starts empty: I type an item and add it, and I can tick items off. It shows how many items are still to buy.",
      "probes": [
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "item|add|new|product|what|artikel|nieuw|toevoeg"
              },
              "type": "Milk"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "add|toevoeg|voeg"
              }
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "item|add|new|product|what|artikel|nieuw|toevoeg"
              },
              "type": "Bread"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "add|toevoeg|voeg"
              }
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "Milk",
              "Bread",
              "2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "item|add|new|product|what|artikel|nieuw|toevoeg"
              },
              "type": "Milk"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "add|toevoeg|voeg"
              }
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "item|add|new|product|what|artikel|nieuw|toevoeg"
              },
              "type": "Bread"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "add|toevoeg|voeg"
              }
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "item|add|new|product|what|artikel|nieuw|toevoeg"
              },
              "type": "Eggs"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "button",
                "name": "add|toevoeg|voeg"
              }
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "checkbox",
                "nth": 0
              }
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "Milk",
              "Bread",
              "Eggs",
              "2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "requests": {
        "nl": "Een boodschappenlijst die leeg begint: ik typ een artikel en voeg het toe, en ik kan artikelen afvinken. Hij toont hoeveel artikelen ik nog moet kopen."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bmi",
      "request": "A body mass index calculator: I type my weight in kilograms and my height in centimetres, and it shows my BMI with one decimal.",
      "probes": [
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "weight|kg|kilo|gewicht"
              },
              "type": "70"
            },
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "height|cm|centi|lengte"
              },
              "type": "175"
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "requests": {
        "nl": "Een BMI-calculator: ik typ mijn gewicht in kilogram en mijn lengte in centimeters, en hij toont mijn BMI met één decimaal."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "words",
      "request": "A word counter: a text box where I write, with the number of words and the number of characters shown below it.",
      "probes": [
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "find": {
                "role": "field",
                "name": "text|write|type|words|content|here|tekst|schrijf"
              },
              "type": "one two three"
            }
          ],
          "expect": {
            "text": [
              "3",
              "13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "requests": {
        "nl": "Een woordenteller: een tekstvak waarin ik schrijf, met daaronder het aantal woorden en het aantal tekens."
      }
    }
  ]
}
